OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AResidents leave devastated
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky as evacuation
OL,5,Acorridor opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents of Oleshky who wished to
OL,8,Fleave had a four-hour window to do so.
OL,9,FA convoy of 25 buses was brought in to
OL,10,Fallow up to 750 people to leave the
OL,11,Ftown until 14:00 (12:00 GMT), along
OL,12,Fwith ambulances for people with limited
OL,13,Fmobility.
OL,15,FSeveral hundred people are understood
OL,16,Fto have decided to stay, despite the
OL,17,Fwidespread devastation and the lack of
OL,18,Fgas, electricity and running water.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
